## The Three Systems

| System | Role | Mode | Trigger |
|--------|------|------|--------|
| **PLATO** | Pre-cognitive deep research | Silent → Deep analysis | Before major decisions |
| **COUNTER** | Darwin survival testing | Silent → Stress test | After PLATO approves |
| **JUDGE** | Matrix final authority | Silent → Report on trigger | Continuous |

